      NULL COALESCING :
               null coalescing means If the given value is null or undifined it prints the alternate value whicj is given.
              Sysntax :
                    value ?? alternative_value;
           EG :
            let age = null;
            console.log(age ?? "it is null");  --------->output : it is null
